","x":1145,"y":1373,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"것이고","x":1262,"y":1373,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉","x":1376,"y":1374,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"지연은","x":1460,"y":1374,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"없을","x":1578,"y":1373,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1661,"y":1374,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"반면에","x":1787,"y":1375,"width":94,"height":40}]},{"text":"패킷이 주기적이 아니라 몰려서(버스트) 도착한다면, 상당한 평균 큐잉 지연이 생길 것","words":[{"text":"패킷이","x":577,"y":1432,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"주기적이","x":690,"y":1433,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"아니라","x":839,"y":1433,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"몰려서(버스트)","x":951,"y":1433,"width":226,"height":40},{"text":"도착한다면,","x":1191,"y":1435,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"상당한","x":1383,"y":1435,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"평균","x":1499,"y":1436,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉","x":1578,"y":1435,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"지연이","x":1661,"y":1436,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"생길","x":1775,"y":1436,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"것","x":1854,"y":1439,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"이다. 예를 들어, N개 패킷이 동시에 (L/R)N 초마다 도착한다고 하자. 그러면 처음에","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":578,"y":1493,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":670,"y":1495,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":752,"y":1495,"width":76,"height":37},{"text":"N개","x":842,"y":1495,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"패킷이","x":919,"y":1494,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"동시에","x":1034,"y":1495,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"(L/R)N","x":1152,"y":1500,"width":108,"height":34},{"text":"초마다","x":1270,"y":1496,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"도착한다고","x":1388,"y":1497,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"하자.","x":1574,"y":1497,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"그러면","x":1668,"y":1498,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"처음에","x":1788,"y":1497,"width":93,"height":41}]},{"text":"전송된 패킷은 큐잉 지연이 없다. 그리고 두 번째 전송된 패킷은 L/R 초의 지연을 가진","words":[{"text":"전송된","x":578,"y":1555,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"패킷은","x":692,"y":1556,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"큐잉","x":804,"y":1555,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"지연이","x":886,"y":1555,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"없다.","x":1000,"y":1556,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1087,"y":1556,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1200,"y":1558,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"번째","x":1248,"y":1557,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"전송된","x":1329,"y":1558,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"패킷은","x":1443,"y":1558,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"L/R","x":1556,"y":1563,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"초의","x":1623,"y":1559,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"지연을","x":1707,"y":1559,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"가진","x":1820,"y":1559,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"다. 이것을 일반화하면, n 번째 전송된 패킷은 이 - I)L/R 초의 큐잉 지연을 겪는다고","words":[{"text":"다.","x":577,"y":1617,"width":41,"height":38},{"text":"이것을","x":635,"y":1617,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"일반화하면,","x":751,"y":1617,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"n","x":939,"y":1631,"width":18,"height":19},{"text":"번째","x":974,"y":1617,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"전송된","x":1054,"y":1618,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"패킷은","x":1169,"y":1617,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1283,"y":1624,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"-","x":1329,"y":1637,"width":25,"height":4},{"text":"I)L/R","x":1375,"y":1624,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"초의","x":1471,"y":1619,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉","x":1552,"y":1620,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"지연을","x":1636,"y":1620,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"겪는다고","x":1753,"y":1620,"width":130,"height":37}]},{"text":"추정할 수 있다. 이 예제의 평균 큐잉 지연을 계산하는 것은 연습문제로 남겨 둔다.","words":[{"text":"추정할","x":576,"y":1679,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":690,"y":1679,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":739,"y":1679,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":826,"y":1679,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"예제의","x":872,"y":1678,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"평균","x":984,"y":1679,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"큐잉","x":1062,"y":1679,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"지연을","x":1144,"y":1679,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"계산하는","x":1257,"y":1680,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"것은","x":1406,"y":1680,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"연습문제로","x":1487,"y":1681,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"남겨","x":1668,"y":1682,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"둔다.","x":1748,"y":1681,"width":75,"height":38}]},{"text":"주기적인 도착에 대한 앞의 두 예는 다소 이론적인 것이다. 일반적으로 큐에 도작","words":[{"text":"주기적인","x":642,"y":1739,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"도착에","x":790,"y":1740,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":906,"y":1739,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"앞의","x":987,"y":1740,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1066,"y":1743,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"예는","x":1116,"y":1741,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"다소","x":1196,"y":1741,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"이론적인","x":1278,"y":1742,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1429,"y":1742,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1554,"y":1743,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"큐에","x":1736,"y":1742,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"도작","x":1818,"y":1744,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 프로세스는 랜덤(random)하다. 즉, 패킷의 도착에 전혀 고정된 패턴이 없고, 패것","words":[{"text":"하는","x":576,"y":1801,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스는","x":655,"y":1800,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"랜덤(random)하다.","x":838,"y":1801,"width":281,"height":39},{"text":"즉,","x":1134,"y":1804,"width":41,"height":36},{"text":"패킷의","x":1191,"y":1802,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"도착에","x":1304,"y":1803,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"전혀","x":1419,"y":1804,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"고정된","x":1498,"y":1804,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"패턴이","x":1614,"y":1803,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"없고,","x":1731,"y":1803,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"패것","x":1819,"y":1803,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"은 임의의 시간만큼 떨어져서 도착하게 된다. 이보다 현실적인 경우에 La/R은 지연에","words":[{"text":"은","x":575,"y":1862,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"임의의","x":625,"y":1861,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"시간만큼","x":739,"y":1862,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"떨어져서","x":889,"